  "schema:name": "Distributed Renewable Energy (DRE) Atlas: Settlements",
  "schema:description": "This collection hosts the underlying data for the [DRE Atlas Planning Platform](https://dre.energydata.info), hosted on [energydata.info](https://energydata.info) — produced by [VIDA](https://vida.place), commissioned and funded by the [Energy Sector Management Assistance Program (ESMAP)](https://www.esmap.org), the [World Bank](https://www.worldbank.org/en/topic/energy), and the [International Finance Corporation (IFC)](https://www.ifc.org).\n\nSettlement-level data for distributed renewable energy (DRE) planning, covering over 1.9 million settlements across 58 countries in Sub-Saharan Africa, Asia, the Pacific, and the Americas. Each settlement carries 50+ attributes covering buildings, population, electricity access, grid infrastructure, energy demand, solar potential, road access, social infrastructure, wealth, agriculture, and security.\n\n- **Interactive platform:** [dre.energydata.info](https://dre.energydata.info) — [User guide](https://vidaplace.notion.site/dre-atlas-user-guide)\n- **Technical documentation:** [DRE Atlas Technical Documentation (PDF)](https://dre.energydata.info/static/DRE-Atlas-Technical-Documentation.pdf)",
